:: intro-scene12a-text [nobr]
<<timed 0.1s>>
     <<type 60ms>>
    <p>There is a clock over the fireplace - maybe look towards that. </p>
    <</type>>
<</timed>>

<<timed 2s>>
     <<type 60ms>>
   <p class="bold handwritten">‘2.10 in the Reading Room’</p>
<</type>>
<</timed>>

<<timed 4s>>
     <<type 60ms>>
